@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title Personalized Product Sales and Workshop Booking System — Context
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
actor Guest
actor Member
actor Staff
actor Owner
actor "AI API" as AI
actor "Email Sender" as Email
actor "Payment Gateway" as Gateway
actor "Admin Technical" as Admin
rectangle "Personalized Product Sales and Workshop Booking System" as System
Guest --> System : booking / lookup / deposit
Member --> System : booking / account / retail
Staff --> System : operations / custody / adjustments
Owner --> System : catalogue / rules / override review
System --> AI : consented image feature request
System --> Email : notification request
System --> Gateway : payment request / verified event
Admin --> System : technical configuration / monitoring
note bottom of Gateway
Redirect is not payment confirmation.
Provider and webhook/IPN contract: TBD.
end note
@enduml
